        {
            "_id": "puc4u7grn4hKEgQ7",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
            "name": "Master of the Hearth",
            "sort": 1000000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "interaction",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A kikimora often shares custody of a home with a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-monster-core-2.Actor.Domovoi]. When the two agree, the circumstance bonus or penalty the domovoi provides to checks to Craft, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Earn Income], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Repair], or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Subsist] in the home increases to +3 or –3, depending on their shared mood. When the domovoi and the kikimora disagree, all such checks always take a –1 circumstance penalty from the dispute. A kikimora must spend a week in a place before these benefits occur.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": []
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
        {
