        {
            "_id": "b06dn1TGwpdkCRXn",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
            "name": "Unravel",
            "sort": 1300000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The kikimora attempts a claw Strike against a creature that's wearing clothing made of fabric. If it hits, the creature's clothing starts to come apart. The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 2} on a critical hit) until it Interacts twice to fix its clothing. Once a creature has had its clothing unraveled, the kikimora can't unravel it further until the target changes clothes.</p>"
                },
